        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, in all of our markets we offer global premium over-the-top (OTT) services such as Netflix, Disney+, YouTube and Amazon Prime Video, and we also offer local OTT services via many of our set-top boxes.",
        "start_character": 43210,
        "end_character": 43423
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001570585-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001570585-26-000014-49a80276367f3892",
        "accession_number": "0001570585-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, through our Inclusive Connectivity initiatives, we offer affordable digital services and devices for those in need to enhance equitable access to the digital world.",
        "start_character": 23117,
        "end_character": 23295
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001570585-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001570585-26-000014-49a80276367f3892",
        "accession_number": "0001570585-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For business and public sector organizations, we provide a range of voice, advanced data, video, wireless and cloud-based services, as well as mobile and FMC services.",
        "start_character": 47636,
        "end_character": 47803
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001570585-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001570585-26-000014-49a80276367f3892",
        "accession_number": "0001570585-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we have agreed to provide certain transitional services for a period of up to 42 months from the closing of the transaction.",
        "start_character": 6165,
        "end_character": 6302
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001570585-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001570585-26-000014-49a80276367f3892",
        "accession_number": "0001570585-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we offer prepaid mobile services, where customers pay in advance for a pre-determined amount of airtime or data and which generally have no minimum contract term.",
        "start_character": 38587,
        "end_character": 38762
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001570585-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001570585-26-000014-49a80276367f3892",
        "accession_number": "0001570585-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we offer “Smart Home” bundles in select markets, providing those customers with enhanced entertainment and home automation and security services.",
        "start_character": 32987,
        "end_character": 33145
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001570585-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001570585-26-000014-49a80276367f3892",
        "accession_number": "0001570585-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In countries where we operate as an MNO, we also offer a number of MVNOs where other mobile providers use our mobile network for their mobile offering.",
        "start_character": 38763,
        "end_character": 38914
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001570585-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001570585-26-000014-49a80276367f3892",
        "accession_number": "0001570585-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Liberty Telecom provides residential and business telecommunication services in Belgium through Telenet, in Ireland through VM Ireland and in Slovakia through UPC Slovakia, and we are a leading fixed network provider in each of these countries.",
        "start_character": 21257,
        "end_character": 21501
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001570585-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001570585-26-000014-49a80276367f3892",
        "accession_number": "0001570585-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Of the six countries in our footprint where we provide electronic communications networks and/or services, five are part of the E.U.: the Republic of Ireland, the Netherlands (nonconsolidated joint venture), Belgium, Luxembourg and Slovakia.",
        "start_character": 85926,
        "end_character": 86167
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001570585-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001570585-26-000014-49a80276367f3892",
        "accession_number": "0001570585-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our intermediate to long-term strategy is to enhance our capabilities and offerings in the business services sector so we become a preferred provider in this market.",
        "start_character": 48767,
        "end_character": 48932
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001570585-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001570585-26-000014-49a80276367f3892",
        "accession_number": "0001570585-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To retain our competitive position, we provide our subscribers with television everywhere products and OTT video services through apps on our video platform through our arrangements with Netflix, Amazon, YouTube and others.",
        "start_character": 74355,
        "end_character": 74578
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001570585-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001570585-26-000014-49a80276367f3892",
        "accession_number": "0001570585-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer value-added services, such as a personal call manager, unified messaging and multiple lines for additional fees.",
